{"title":"Career Roadmap · Data Analyst","role":"Data Analyst","summary":"A Data Analyst collects, cleans, analyses, visualizes, and interprets data to help organizations make better decisions.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Physics"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Data Analyst collects, cleans, analyses, visualizes, and interprets data to help organizations make better decisions."},{"type":"p","text":"A B.Sc. Physics graduate has a strong foundation for this career because Physics develops:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mathematical reasoning"},{"text":"Quantitative analysis"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Problem-solving"},{"text":"Experimental thinking"},{"text":"Data interpretation"},{"text":"Modelling"},{"text":"Scientific computing"},{"text":"The key transition is from scientific data analysis → business/organizational data analysis."}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong profile combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Physics","Statistics","Excel","SQL","Python","Data Visualization","Business Understanding"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical domains include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Retail"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Telecommunications"},{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Scientific and engineering organizations"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Sc. Physics"},{"text":"Physics + mathematics + statistics + analytics"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Data Analyst / BI Analyst"},{"text":"SQL, Excel, Python, dashboards"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Seni